## Phase D1 - Provider Capability Registry

```rust
pub struct ProviderCapability {
    pub inference: bool,
    pub embedding: bool,
    pub reasoning: bool,
    pub streaming: bool,
}

pub trait BrainProvider {
    fn capability(&self) -> ProviderCapability;
}
```

Status: ✅ DONE (provider/mod.rs, candle.rs)

